# POAP KINGS

> POAP KINGS (#{{ site.clanTag | safe }}) is a Clash Royale clan that mints on-chain POAPs to commemorate seasons, milestones, and member achievements. Tagline: "{{ site.tagline | safe }}".

POAP KINGS is a {{ elixirClan.clanLeague | safe }} Clash Royale clan with {{ elixirClan.memberCount }} members, {{ elixirClan.totalTrophies | formatNumber | safe }} total trophies, and a {{ elixirClan.minTrophies | formatNumber | safe }}-trophy minimum. Status: {{ elixirClan.clanStatus | safe }}. Clan tag: #{{ site.clanTag | safe }}. The site, roster, awards, and promotional content are maintained in part by Elixir, the clan's AI agent, which commits updates directly to the repository.

Canonical data lives in build-time JSON at `/data/*.json` and a full-content markdown bundle at `/llms-full.txt`. Fetch those to answer questions without scraping HTML.

## Core pages
- [Home]({{ site.url | safe }}/): clan overview and the latest Elixir message
- [Roster]({{ site.url | safe }}/roster/): live member list with trophies, arenas, roles, and decks
- [Vault]({{ site.url | safe }}/vault/): full POAP collection with types and dates
